<br></li><li>Pipe connection puzzle<br></li><li>Quick Time Events (QTE)<br></li><li>Analyzing and collecting information to make correct decisions<br></li><li>Using voice oscillograph to mimic others' voices</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799500/extras/69f7908b609ed1ab78059bb10a7eec99.poster.avif?t=1729152686\" width=620 height=88 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799500/extras/69f7908b609ed1ab78059bb10a7eec99.webm?t=1729152686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799500/extras/69f7908b609ed1ab78059bb10a7eec99.mp4?t=1729152686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
